// Made with the Ch6 scripts (Manga_Square_Bibliotheque_Sc02).
// - The two hidden stones become signs running a script (the engine ignores
//   BgKind::HiddenItem: the SIL1 Task F fallback). Restore with:
//     HiddenItem(x: 1, y: 18, item: "ITEM_MOON_STONE", flag: "FLAG_SIL_ITEM_BIBLIO_MOON_STONE"),
//     HiddenItem(x: 24, y: 18, item: "ITEM_SUN_STONE", flag: "FLAG_SIL_ITEM_BIBLIO_SUN_STONE"),
// - Manga_Square_Bibliotheque_Sc01 (bypass): the reading area north of the shelves (rows 2-6) is
//   entered across row 7 on (0-1, 7), (6-7, 7) and (12-15, 7); only the last four had the coord,
//   so the player could reach Adrien's desk by the west aisles. The four others get the same
//   coord (VAR_SIL_STORY 63).
[
    Coord(x: 0, y: 7, var: "VAR_SIL_STORY", value: 63, script: "MangaSquare_Bibliotheque_Sc01"),
    Coord(x: 1, y: 7, var: "VAR_SIL_STORY", value: 63, script: "MangaSquare_Bibliotheque_Sc01"),
    Coord(x: 6, y: 7, var: "VAR_SIL_STORY", value: 63, script: "MangaSquare_Bibliotheque_Sc01"),
    Coord(x: 7, y: 7, var: "VAR_SIL_STORY", value: 63, script: "MangaSquare_Bibliotheque_Sc01"),
    Delete(kind: Bg, index: 9),
    Delete(kind: Bg, index: 8),
    Sign(x: 1, y: 18, script: "MangaSquare_Bibliotheque_EventScript_HiddenMoonStone"),
    Sign(x: 24, y: 18, script: "MangaSquare_Bibliotheque_EventScript_HiddenSunStone"),
]
